<title>NETHERLANDS: KOPPELPOORT 1996 NET PROFIT PLUNGES.</title>
<headline>KOPPELPOORT 1996 NET PROFIT PLUNGES.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Yr to Dec 31, 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit			     0.3  vs   1.2</p>
<p>    Dividend (guilders)		  5.00 vs  10.00</p>
<p>    Turnover				60.0  vs  66.6</p>
<p>    Operating profit		     0.6  vs   1.9</p>
<p>    Tax					0.3  vs   0.7</p>
<p>NOTE - Capital goods trader Koppelpoort Holding NV</p>
<p>previously said it expected profits to fall in 1996.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
</text>
